====================

MP3deck release binaries include the third-party software listed below.
MP3deck's own source code is under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

The MP3 and AAC decoders come from Symphonia, which is licensed under the
Mozilla Public License 2.0. MP3deck uses Symphonia unmodified. Its source
code is available at https://github.com/pdeljanov/Symphonia and on
crates.io.

MP3deck does not include ffmpeg. For formats it cannot decode itself, it
runs an ffmpeg that the user installed separately.


